# JSON counts as a "code" extension in graphify, but every .json here is
# fixture/config data (mockFixtures, asset catalogs, tool config), not
# architecture — indexing it produces 500-edge "lemmas" god nodes.
*.json

# Markup/config are indexed by graphify as "document" nodes. This graph is
# scoped to code architecture, so exclude docs and config markup (AGENTS.md,
# SKILL.md, ADRs, CI yaml, detekt config, index.html, …).
*.md
*.txt
*.yml
*.yaml
*.html

# Build and tooling output not covered by graphify's built-in skips
# (build/, .idea/, node_modules/, graphify-out/ are already skipped).
.gradle/
.kotlin/
kotlin-js-store/
